<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN JUNE PRODUCER OUTPUT PRICES RISE.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN JUNE PRODUCER OUTPUT PRICES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's manufacturing output prices rose 0.2 percent in June to be 1.5 percent higher on the year, the Australian Bureau of Statistics reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prices rose 0.2 percent in May for an 0.8 percent year-on-year rise.</p>
</text>
